+    // Native FP8 (d4r_wmma12f8_*, D4R_ZLUDA_WMMA_FP8_NATIVE): the "widening" keeps the e4m3 bytes, two per
+    // dword in the low 16 bits and in the same slots the f16 widening fills, so the f16 gathers above move them;
